# SCT .dockerignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything that is NOT needed to build or run the container.
#
# Excluded:
#   - data/            runtime logs + DB files (MySQL is external via compose)
#   - uploads/         uploaded file store
#   - __pycache__/*    python bytecode
#   - *.pyc            compiled python
#   - .env*            secrets / dotenv (do not bake secrets into images)
#   - venv/  env/      python virtualenvs
#   - node_modules/    npm deps (app is stdlib+Jinja2+pymysql only)
#   - *.egg-info/      sdist/wheel metadata
#   - git metadata     .git/ and .gitignore/.dockerignore are NOT needed at runtime
#   - server.log       derived artifact

data/
uploads/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
venv/
.env
env/
node_modules/
*.egg-info/
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
docs/setup-mysql.md
scripts/setup-mysql.sh
tests/test_sct_mysql.py
